<view class="page"><text class="heading">拍下今日穿搭</text><text class="desc">不用先录完整衣橱。AI 只拆主要衣物，整张人物照在真实裁剪保存后立即删除。</text><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="choosePhoto">{{photo ? '重新选择照片' : '拍照 / 从相册选择'}}</button><image wx:if="{{photo && !originalDeleted}}" class="preview" src="{{photo}}" mode="aspectFit"/><text wx:if="{{originalDeleted}}" class="privacy">✓ 云端人物原图已删除</text><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text><view wx:for="{{detections}}" wx:for-index="slotIndex" wx:key="detectionId" class="card"><text class="title">{{item.category}}{{item.color ? ' · '+item.color : ''}}{{item.pattern ? ' · '+item.pattern : ''}}</text><view wx:if="{{item.processingStatus==='cropped'}}" class="processing">等待抠图</view><view wx:elif="{{item.processingStatus==='processing'}}" class="processing">正在生成平铺图、抠图并核验…</view><view wx:elif="{{item.processingStatus==='failed'}}" class="failed"><text>本件未能可靠拆解</text><text>{{item.processingError}}</text></view><block wx:else><image wx:if="{{item.imageUrl}}" class="detected-image" src="{{item.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFit"/><text wx:if="{{item.imageOrigin==='flat_lay'}}" class="verified">✓ AI平铺图已通过真实性核验 · {{item.fidelityScore}}%</text><text wx:elif="{{item.imageOrigin==='cutout'}}" class="verified">✓ AI保真整理图已通过真实性核验 · {{item.fidelityScore}}%</text><text class="new-default">默认：作为新衣加入衣橱</text><block wx:if="{{item.topMatches.length}}"><text class="hint">可能已在衣橱 · 找到 {{item.topMatches.length}} 件可靠候选</text><view wx:for="{{item.topMatches}}" wx:for-item="match" wx:key="id" class="match {{selected[slotIndex]===match.id?'active':''}}" data-slot="{{slotIndex}}" data-id="{{match.id}}" bindtap="selectMatch"><image src="{{match.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>{{match.name}}</text><text class="hint">综合相似度 {{match.similarity}}%</text><text class="hint">{{selected[slotIndex]===match.id?'已选择使用这件已有衣物':'点此改为已有衣物'}}</text></view></view></block><block wx:else><text class="hint">未发现明显相同的已有衣物</text><text class="hint">将默认作为新衣加入衣橱</text></block></block></view><view class="card"><text class="title">识别失败或候选不对？</text><text class="hint">直接勾选最近衣物也能完成记录。</text><view class="chips"><text wx:for="{{recentItems}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{selectedRecent[item.id]?'active':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleRecent">{{item.name}}</text></view></view><picker mode="selector" range="{{scenes}}" value="{{sceneIndex}}" bindchange="onSceneChange"><view class="picker">场景：{{scenes[sceneIndex]}} ›</view></picker><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="confirm">一次确认并记录</button><button class="ghost" bindtap="manualOnly">只用最近衣物</button></view>
